Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.81,0:21:34.61,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\blur8}只為能看見你曾經
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.61,0:21:38.49,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8}幻影般的笑容
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.49,0:21:43.74,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur8}我始終 呆立原地
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.45,0:21:49.08,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\blur8}童年瑣碎的幸福
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.08,0:21:52.00,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8}兩人獨守的秘密
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.42,0:21:57.13,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)\blur8}自你消失的瞬間起
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.13,0:22:00.51,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8}都化作模糊泡影
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.88,0:22:04.43,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8}永別了
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.43,0:22:07.85,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8}就算不是你也沒關係
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.85,0:22:11.94,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8}只要掌心溫度依舊如常
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.94,0:22:13.23,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8}永別了
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.23,0:22:16.73,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8}連我心底的黑暗
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.73,0:22:20.03,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8}都顯得如此微不足道
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.03,0:22:23.36,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)\blur8}在這盛夏之時
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.57,0:22:26.28,ED-CN,,0,0,10,,{\blur8\an8}倘若真有怪物蟄伏在心中
Dialogue: 1,0:22:26.28,0:22:29.66,ED-CN,,0,0,10,,{\fad(0,300)\blur8\an8}縱使它已將你取代
Dialogue: 1,0:22:30.62,0:22:35.21,ED-CN,,0,0,10,,{\blur8\an8}只願 只願 這個夏天
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.21,0:22:40.09,ED-CN,,0,0,10,,{\fad(0,300)\blur8\an8}能安然度過就好
